  "reflectionText": "The voice said: comfort, comfort my people. The grass withers and the flower fades, but the word of our God stands forever. He will feed his flock like a shepherd, gather the lambs in his arm, carry them in his bosom. How does comfort arrive when it comes in the shape of a shepherd carrying the lambs in his arm?"
